# --- Scratch configs & reference data ---------------------------------
# Ad-hoc portfolio configs, one-off analysis scripts, and manually
# downloaded ticker lists. Nothing in the app reads these. The two TOMLs
# that ARE load-bearing stay tracked: config.toml (src/main.go) and
# strategy_library.toml (ui/chat.go, strategies/README.md).
comprehensive_test.toml
error_test.toml
final_test.toml
lua_test.toml
test.toml
diversified_buy_hold.toml
megacap_buy_hold.toml
nasdaqlisted.txt
otherlisted.txt
appconstraints.txt
analysis/

# --- Agent workflow scaffolding ---------------------------------------
# Local tooling, not part of the application. Present on disk so the
# unattended agent can read them; never tracked, so they stay out of PRs.
CLAUDE.md
TASKS.md
AGENT_LOG.md
.claude/
